  m_Name: KidsHouseInfo
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  houseType: 3
  menuTitle: School-Age Children
  normalChoices:
  - choiceName: Wait for Notice
    carNumberMod: 0
    horseNumberMod: 0
    kidNumberMod: 0
    petNumberMod: 0
    homeHardeningMod: 0
    carSpeedMod: 2
    carLeaveTime: 2
    choiceDetail: 
    endGameFeedback: Families with children were unprepared for an evening evacuation,
      and there was a lot of confusion.
    isLocked: 0
  - choiceName: Pick up Children
    carNumberMod: 0
    horseNumberMod: 0
    kidNumberMod: 2
    petNumberMod: 0
    homeHardeningMod: 0
    carSpeedMod: 0
    carLeaveTime: 1
    choiceDetail: 
    endGameFeedback: Families with children rushed to the school, which added unnecessary
      congestion in that area. Families are reminded that the school is one of the
      safest places in our community.
    isLocked: 0
  lockedChoices:
  - choiceName: Safer at School
    carNumberMod: 0
    horseNumberMod: 0
    kidNumberMod: 0
    petNumberMod: 0
    homeHardeningMod: 0
    carSpeedMod: 2
    carLeaveTime: 1
    choiceDetail: 'You know the children are safer at school and have a plan that
      they know: they will stay at school until it is safe to pick them up.'
    endGameFeedback: Children sheltered at the school and were safe there. Thankfully
      families knew to evacuate first and wait until it was safe to go to the school
      to pick up the kids.
    isLocked: 1
  longerTitle: School-Age Children
  description: "Families with children have additional responsibilities to juggle
    during an evacuation. It is very important to make plans in advance and consider
    multiple scenarios and consequences of choices. Some parents choose to pick up
    their children from school when the evacuation notice goes out. However, this
    causes additional congestion around the school. Schools tend to be extremely
    safe places to shelter during an emergency. Parents should consider leaving the
    children at the school and waiting until it is safe to pick them up.\r"
  carNumber: 1
  horseNumber: 0
  petNumber: 0
  kidNumber: 0
  carSpeed: 1
  carSpawnTime: 1
